[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="Document" load_steps=2 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/core/document.gd" id="1_doc"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_doc")
id = &"d15_quarterly_report"
title = "Quarterly report, Q3 FY1974"
byline = "carbon copy, corrections in her own hand"
hand = 0
body = "WORK UNIT 1615-C
QUARTERLY PROGRESS — Q3 FY1974

SUMMARY

No run was conducted this quarter. Analysis
of Runs 1 through 7 is complete and the
finding is unchanged: a single imposed
luminaire on a 24 hour cycle restores group
temporal synchrony within four days. Groups
receiving no signal do not re-synchronise
within the observation period.

The work unit's stated objective is met. I
have said so in three consecutive reports.

OBSERVATIONS NOT REQUIRED BY THE OBJECTIVE

In seven runs, subjects have reported the
observer's position at the luminaire without
being told it. Six of seven. The seventh was
Run 4, in which the observer stood elsewhere
by my instruction.

I record this because it is consistent and
because I do not have an account of it. It is
not attention to the lamp: subjects describe
the observer as an interruption of the lamp,
and describe the interruption before it
occurs. Twice with the observer absent.

RECOMMENDATION

That the work unit be concluded at the end of
FY1975 and the installation removed.

                              M. KETCH

               [in pencil, later, different ink]
               Not renewed. Not removed either."
